## ENTERPRISE AI UPGRADES

### Vector RAG Requirements
- **pgvector mandatory**: All RAG flows MUST use vector embeddings, no prompt-only search
- **Hybrid search required**: Combine vector similarity (70%) + BM25 keyword (30%) for 3x recall improvement
- **Embedding generation**: Use `gemini-embedding-001-exp` for free tier, OpenAI `text-embedding-3-small` for production
- **Similarity threshold**: Minimum 0.7 cosine similarity for retrieval, 0.8+ for high confidence
- **RLS policies**: All document chunks must be deal-scoped with `tenant_id` filtering

### Graph Neural Network Matching
- **Network graph required**: Build `network_graph` table with edges (introduced, worked_with, co_invested)
- **GraphSAGE embeddings**: Compute node embeddings (128-dim) from graph structure + node features
- **Match scoring**: Use cosine similarity on GNN embeddings, not rule-based prompts
- **Risk flags**: cap_hit (intros/month > threshold), stale_data (>30d inactive), style_mismatch (embedding distance >0.7)
- **Performance target**: 20-30% improvement over prompt-based matching on relational data

### Hybrid Company Intelligence
- **Multi-source search**: Chain Tavily API (enterprise search) + Apollo.io (B2B contacts) + pgvector cache
- **Fallback chain**: pgvector cache → Tavily → Apollo → Perplexity sonar-pro
- **Freshness scoring**: Auto-refresh queue for stale company data (>90 days)
- **M&A predictive layer**: Extract synergy_potential (revenue_growth, competitor_overlap) from LLM
- **Structured output**: Return JSON with freshness_score, source_quality, synergy_potential

### FINRA-Compliant Observability
- **OpenTelemetry traces**: Every LLM/external API call must have trace_id, span_id
- **AI audits table**: Log all operations (llm_call, embedding_generation, vector_search, external_api)
- **Bias monitoring**: Track sector skew, demographic bias in matches, log to bias_flags array
- **Immutable audit logs**: All AI operations logged with human_review flags for compliance
- **Cost tracking**: Log input_tokens, output_tokens, cost_usd for every LLM call
- **Grounding scores**: Track confidence_score, grounding_score for every RAG response

### Dashboard KPIs (Enterprise AI)
- **AI Velocity Score**: Days to LOI prediction using ML model
- **Pipeline Health**: RAG confidence <0.7 flags review, drift detection
- **Network ROI**: GNN path efficiency (avg hops to close), not just intro count
- **Intel Freshness**: Auto-refresh queue for stale companies (<90d threshold)
- **Compliance Score**: FINRA Rule 3110 human-in-loop logging, unreviewed_flags tracking

### API Provider Priority
- **Primary**: OpenAI GPT-4-turbo (for synthesis), Gemini 2.0 Flash (for embeddings)
- **Secondary**: Perplexity sonar-pro (for external intel), Tavily (for enterprise search)
- **Fallback**: Custom logic when APIs unavailable
- **NO Lovable AI Gateway**: Use direct API calls to OpenAI, Perplexity, Gemini

### Feature Branch
- **Branch**: `dashboard-enterprise-ai`
- **Migrations**: `enterprise_ai_schema.sql` (pgvector, network_graph, ai_audits)
- **Edge Functions**: `donna-search` (vector RAG), `network-match` (GNN), `hybrid-company-search` (multi-source)

